units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
newton on
timestep 0.001
lattice fcc 3.52
region whole block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol density lx ly lz
thermo 100
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 10
run 220000
unfix 1
